// # Website Test Suite Anchor - Six Ported Assertions
//
// Logline: Bind the six website assertion pages into one suite over the published site.
//
// Setup: Each page owns its own main and runs standalone; this shim only binds them.
//
// Beats:
//   1. copy_test.oo — the static home clipboard path and the named stealth mode.
//   2. hooks_test.oo — the script hooks, the sitemap host, and the page skeleton.
//   3. layout_test.oo — the viewport tag, the live links, and the small-screen rules.
//   4. links_test.oo — the owned links that answer and the local references that exist.
//   5. privacy_test.oo — the zero-trust privacy gate over every published file.
//   6. shim_test.oo — the install shim guards and the canonical master installer.

import "copy_test.oo";
import "hooks_test.oo";
import "layout_test.oo";
import "links_test.oo";
import "privacy_test.oo";
import "shim_test.oo";
